## Purpose

Continue the live canonical product stack from #1767 and harden the existing WP-47 decision-trace authority without touching Binance, recovery, financial, Host, risk or qualification authorities.

Current parent branch: #1767 / `integration/binance-after-wp59-trace-product-stack-20261005-sol56` (current parent SHA is always the PR base SHA shown by GitHub). The worker is still advancing this two-path branch, so the PR metadata `head_sha` is the canonical exact-head receipt rather than a duplicated hard-coded SHA in this body.

Mechanical invariant: parent -> current head must remain ahead-only / behind 0, merge-base exactly parent, effective delta exactly two paths. If that invariant stops holding, this PR is not an integration candidate until reconverged.

## Root defects closed

1. torn durable append from in-place JSONL publication;
2. split lock identity through path aliases / hard-linked final destinations;
3. two-read verification TOCTOU between loaded rows and `verify()`;
4. non-canonical record hash text admission;
5. polymorphic diagnostic metric scalar ingress.

## Implementation

- whole append transaction uses canonical `durable_path_lock(self.path)`;
- full trace image publishes through canonical `atomic_write_bytes()`; the shared primitive stages and fsyncs bytes, validates final aliases, replaces atomically and syncs the parent directory where supported;
- `_records_are_valid()` validates the exact already-loaded snapshot and is reused by append/records/verify;
